        "end_character": 19065
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000030625-26-000003",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000030625-26-000003-549683a7c8849c71",
        "accession_number": "0000030625-26-000003",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-17",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Furthermore, we continue to develop and commercialize new products with greater efficiency and capacity in our pressure exchanger portfolio.",
        "start_character": 20904,
        "end_character": 21044
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000030625-26-000003",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000030625-26-000003-549683a7c8849c71",
        "accession_number": "0000030625-26-000003",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-17",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, we have moved beyond exploring new additive manufacturing capabilities, such as 3D printing and fast casting methods, and are exploring ways to economically scale these techniques as another means of manufacturing our products to both reduce lead time and lower our production costs.",
        "start_character": 20352,
        "end_character": 20648
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000030625-26-000003",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000030625-26-000003-549683a7c8849c71",
        "accession_number": "0000030625-26-000003",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-17",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, we manufacture double case diffuser style barrel pumps for medium duty applications in refining and petrochemical applications and submersible pump for deep well pumping in irrigation and municipal water supply service.",
        "start_character": 17771,
        "end_character": 18003
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000030625-26-000003",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000030625-26-000003-549683a7c8849c71",
        "accession_number": "0000030625-26-000003",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-17",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In geographic regions where we are positioned to provide quick response, we believe customers have traditionally relied on us, rather than our competitors, for aftermarket products due to our highly engineered and customized products.",
        "start_character": 11949,
        "end_character": 12183
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000030625-26-000003",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000030625-26-000003-549683a7c8849c71",
        "accession_number": "0000030625-26-000003",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-17",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Our largest business segment is FPD, through which we design, manufacture, pretest, distribute and service highly custom engineered pumps, pre-configured industrial pumps, pump systems, mechanical seals and auxiliary systems (collectively referred to as \"original equipment\") and related services.",
        "start_character": 15171,
        "end_character": 15468
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000030625-26-000003",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000030625-26-000003-549683a7c8849c71",
        "accession_number": "0000030625-26-000003",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-17",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Our products are currently manufactured in 37 manufacturing facilities worldwide, 12 of which are located in in North America, 11 in Europe, eight in Asia Pacific and six in Latin America, and we have 126 QRCs, including those co-located in manufacturing facilities and/or shared with FCD.",
        "start_character": 16560,
        "end_character": 16849
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000030625-26-000003",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000030625-26-000003-549683a7c8849c71",
        "accession_number": "0000030625-26-000003",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-17",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Through our manufacturing platform and global network of Quick Response Centers (\"QRCs\"), we offer a broad array of aftermarket equipment services, such as installation, advanced diagnostics and turnkey maintenance programs.",
        "start_character": 905,
        "end_character": 1129
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000030625-26-000003",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000030625-26-000003-549683a7c8849c71",
        "accession_number": "0000030625-26-000003",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-17",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also provide engineered aftermarket services through our global network of 126 QRCs, some of which are co-located in manufacturing facilities, in 48 countries.",
        "start_character": 18272,
        "end_character": 18434
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000030625-26-000003",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000030625-26-000003-549683a7c8849c71",
        "accession_number": "0000030625-26-000003",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-17",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also provide in-house repair and return manufacturing services worldwide through our manufacturing facilities.",
        "start_character": 27346,
        "end_character": 27459
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000030625-26-000003",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000030625-26-000003-549683a7c8849c71",
        "accession_number": "0000030625-26-000003",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-17",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are a world-leading manufacturer and aftermarket service provider of comprehensive flow control systems.",
